      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_6ab8280c",
      "@type": "VisualMaterial",
      "instance_name": "group_of_young_men",
      "label": "people",
      "description": "A group of six young men standing in a line, all raising their hands in the air. Their faces are obscured by black rectangles. They are dressed in casual clothing such as t-shirts and tank tops. The group appears to be posing for a photo in an indoor setting, possibly a living room or similar space. Their posture and raised hands suggest a celebratory or defiant gesture, which is central to the meme's message.",
