    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_f3e7738f",
      "@type": "Scene",
      "instance_name": "defiant_pose_scene",
      "label": "Group of young men posing defiantly with raised hands",
      "description": "A scene depicting six young men standing in a line, all raising their hands in the air in a synchronized gesture. Their faces are obscured by black rectangles. They are dressed in casual clothing such as t-shirts and tank tops. The group appears to be posing for a photo in an indoor setting, possibly a living room or similar space. Their posture and raised hands suggest a celebratory or defiant gesture, which is central to the meme's message.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
