      "description": "The emotion expressed is contempt, conveyed through the sarcastic and dismissive tone of the overlaid text, which implies disdain for the group's behavior and suggests that their 'pride' is so extreme or inappropriate that it makes 'shame' seem even more undesirable. This reflects a judgmental and derogatory attitude toward the group depicted.",
