      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_5a00aece",
      "@type": "ToxicityAssessment",
      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Hateful",
      "description": "The meme directly attacks or devalues a group based on their appearance or behavior, using a sarcastic and dismissive tone to convey contempt. The text 'if this is what they call pride.. then i don't wanna see what they call shame' implies a negative judgment of the group's actions, fitting the definition of a hateful meme.",
